    {
      "source": "If the method parameter is of type <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> it will be resolved by\n<a href=\"MatrixVariableMapMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet.mvc.method.annotation\"><code>MatrixVariableMapMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> instead unless the annotation\nspecifies a name in which case it is considered to be a single attribute of\ntype map (vs multiple attributes collected in a map).",
      "translation": "如果方法参数的类型为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>，它将由<a href=\"MatrixVariableMapMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet.mvc.method.annotation\"><code>MatrixVariableMapMethodArgumentResolver</code></a>解析，除非注解指定了名称，在这种情况下，它被视为类型为 map 的单个属性（而不是在 map 中收集的多个属性）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create the <a href=\"../../../../method/annotation/AbstractNamedValueMethodArgumentResolver.NamedValueInfo.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.method.annotation\"><code>AbstractNamedValueMethodArgumentResolver.NamedValueInfo</code></a> object for the given method parameter. Implementations typically\nretrieve the method annotation by means of <a href=\"../../../../../core/MethodParameter.html#getParameterAnnotation(java.lang.Class)\"><code>MethodParameter.getParameterAnnotation(Class)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的方法参数创建<a href=\"../../../../method/annotation/AbstractNamedValueMethodArgumentResolver.NamedValueInfo.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.method.annotation\"><code>AbstractNamedValueMethodArgumentResolver.NamedValueInfo</code></a>对象。实现通常通过<a href=\"../../../../../core/MethodParameter.html#getParameterAnnotation(java.lang.Class)\"><code>MethodParameter.getParameterAnnotation(Class)</code></a>检索方法注解。",
      "count": 2
    },
